    "title": "Senate passes major housing bill - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Julie Strupp ,\n9 hours ago The Senate passed a bipartisan bill on Oct. 9 that aims to boost the nation’s housing supply via a wide range of mechanisms. The ROAD to Housing Act directs HUD to develop best practices, in collaboration with housing experts, that equip state and local governments with an array of options to increase housing production. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
